    kind: work_item  # ce09
    title: "The INV-pitab grammar-missing warning is appended to an AnalysisRun that is then discarded, and pass_silence's claim that no carrier exists for dependency_unavailable is false (base.py returns run=run)"  # ce09
    status: needs_human_review  # ce09
    priority: 2  # ce09
    parent:  # ce09
    tags:  # ce09
    - analysis_quality  # ce09
